%% UC-04 — Browse & explore habits (locale-aware)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (habitsRouter)
    participant N4 as Neo4j

    P->>F: Open Explore tab
    F->>B: GET /api/v1/habits?lang=de (Bearer token)
    B->>N4: MATCH (h:Habit) RETURN h
    N4-->>B: habit nodes
    B->>B: displayText = translationDE || original
    B-->>F: [{uuid, original, translationEN, translationDE, displayText}]
    F->>F: Render list / graph / stats views
